# LeakSanitizer suppressions for ci/opcua_cli.
#
# open62541's default configuration allocates a stdout logger
# (UA_Log_Stdout_new) that it attaches to the client/server config and
# shares with the EventLoop; the top-level handle is not freed on
# delete. It is a small, fixed allocation inside the library under test's
# dependency, not in tsf-opcua code, and does not grow per operation.
# The real leak gate for tsf-opcua's own code is the Test Environment
# suite (tsf-opcua-ts), whose agent library runs under ASan.
leak:UA_Log_Stdout_new
